//- UserCombinedPage.js
// A magic fragment whose consumer selects an interface field that the SERVER arm
// implements with a client edge (`Page.owner`, a resolver returning the
// `PageOwner` model).
//
// The transplant onto `page` must carry that edge as a `ClientEdgeToClientObject`
// whose backing field is the `owner` resolver, as the edge's own linked field
// does. That puts `...PageOwnerEdgeResolverFragment` into the operation text and
// gives exec time a resolver node to collect for each server record.
/**
 * @relayField User.combined_page: IPage
 * @rootFragment UserCombinedPageResolverFragment
 * @returnFragment UserCombinedPageReturnFragment
 */
graphql`fragment UserCombinedPageResolverFragment on User {
  page {
    ...UserCombinedPageReturnFragment
  }
}`

